stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> candidate: 任务信息 / 人工录入 / Agent 提案
  candidate --> active: 证据与权限规则满足 / 获准审核
  candidate --> rejected: 拒绝或不适合保存
  active --> conflicted: 发现互斥证据
  conflicted --> active: 处理争议 / 明确适用条件
  active --> superseded: 新版本或新结论替代
  active --> expired: 有效期结束
  active --> archived: 授权归档
  superseded --> archived
  expired --> archived
  archived --> candidate: 经授权重新评估
  active --> deleted: 授权删除
  archived --> deleted: 授权删除
  candidate --> deleted: 授权删除
  deleted --> [*]: 清理派生索引与缓存
